,"description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":11,"created_at":"2025-03-05T12:06:51Z","updated_at":"2025-07-16T16:32:18Z","closed_at":"2025-07-16T16:32:17Z","assignee":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n-Reproducible in Godot 4.4\n-Not reproducible in Godot 4.3 and prior\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10 - Godot 4.4 (Forward+) - NVIDIA RTX 2080 SUPER - 32 GO RAM - Intel Core i7-9700KF\n\n### Issue description\n\nAfter switching my project from Godot 4.3 to Godot 4.4, I'm being met with a lot of strange visual artifacts, like the entire game is \"smeary\".\nIt seems to only happen when having TAA turned on, but having TAA on in Godot 4.3 didn't result in these artifacts (or at least not as noticeable).\nIt happens in Editor and in build, and running an older build from Godot 4.3 works completely fine.\n\nOne thing to note is that having a screen shader (via creating a plane mesh) makes the effect worse, but it still happens without the shader.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c005af3b-b68a-4e5d-babf-2d5d0a829f6e\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4fb74221-4491-4ab0-8d4a-6d5be9ba41e8\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nTurn TAA on\n\nTo make the effect more noticeable (on my end):\n-Create a new MeshInstance3D and set its mesh to a QuadMesh\n-Enable Flip Faces\n-Set its width and height to 2\n-Set its material to a shader material and apply this shader:\n\n```glsl\nshader_type spatial;\nrender_mode unshaded, fog_disabled;\n\nuniform sampler2D screen_texture: hint_screen_texture, repeat_disable, filter_nearest;\n\nvoid vertex() {\n  POSITION = vec4(VERTEX.xy, 1.0, 1.0);\n}\n\nvoid fragment() {\n\tvec4 color = texture(screen_texture, SCREEN_UV);\n\n\tALBEDO = color.rgb;\n\tALPHA = color.a;\n}\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[issue103629_mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19115223/issue103629_mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103629/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103629/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}